        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Strange Attractors",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Edward Lorenz, 1963, derived three ODEs by truncating the convection equations to a single\nFourier–Galerkin mode set. Their accidental discovery of SDIC (a rounded restart diverging from the\noriginal run) launched chaos theory."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-STRANGE-ATTRACTORS.md#014",
      "path": [
        "06-STRANGE-ATTRACTORS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
