        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Strange Attractors",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n   x' = sigma (y - x)              sigma = Prandtl number   (=10)\n   y' = x (rho - z) - y            rho   = Rayleigh number  (=28, the knob)\n   z' = x y - b z                  b     = geometry factor  (=8/3)"
    }
